    {
      "Original": "Become a small territorial wisp (x0.50, raised off the floor).\nAn unobtrusive marker for a DM who isn't physically in the scene.",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "变为一团小型浮空光点（缩放至 0.50 倍）。\n适合不直接出场的主持人标示所在位置。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Hide",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "Translated": "隐藏",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Unhide",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawRows",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "direct string argument 0 to Dalamud.Bindings.ImGui.ImGui.Selectable",
      "Translated": "取消隐藏",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Pull your character out of the render entirely: a DM 'here but not\nphysically present' switch. Click again to reappear.",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "将自己的角色完全隐藏，主持人仍可留在现场\n而不以实体出现。再次点击即可现身。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Rename nameplate to disguise",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": true,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.Checkbox",
      "Translated": "将名牌改为伪装对象的名字",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Requires the Moniker (HMoniker) plugin, v2.1 or newer, installed and enabled.\nIf you have it and this is still disabled, its IPC version may be older than 2.1.",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "需安装并启用 2.1 或更高版本的 Moniker（HMoniker）。\n如果已安装但此项仍不可用，其 IPC 版本可能低于 2.1。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Also set your nameplate to the disguise's name via Moniker,\nsynced to nearby players through HMS. Revert clears it.",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "同时通过 Moniker 将名牌改为伪装对象的名字，\n并通过 HMS 同步给附近玩家。解除伪装时将清除该名字。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Log in to disguise yourself.",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextDisabled",
      "Translated": "登录后即可使用伪装。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Scale",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "Translated": "缩放",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Sizes the active disguise, applied immediately.\nNative = the selected mob's authored scale (per-mob; tracks the model, e.g. x2.0 for Galatea Magna).\nx0.5 / x1 = quick multipliers; the box and slider set any custom size (0.1 … 10).",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "Translated": "立即调整当前伪装的尺寸。\n原始大小采用所选怪物的模型比例，各怪物不同，如大型伽拉忒亚人偶为 2.0 倍。\n可选 0.5 倍、1 倍，或用输入框和滑动条指定 0.1 至 10 之间的数值。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Custom",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.TextUnformatted",
      "Translated": "自定义",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Type an exact scale (0.1 to 10). Anything above 10 clamps to 10.",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "输入精确缩放比例（0.1 至 10），超过上限时将设为 10。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Pick a catalog row first (a plain click selects it), then Disguise wears it.",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "Translated": "先单击目录中的一项，再点击伪装，即可使用该外观。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Pick a catalog row first (a plain click selects it), then Spawn drops a puppet wearing it.",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "先单击目录中的一项，再点击生成，即可创建使用该外观的人偶。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Restore your real model + size and un-stick any animation.",
      "Context": "MainWindow.DrawHeader",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "恢复真实模型和大小，并解除卡住的动作。",
